        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, single-Si, at regional storage
Shares of production in US (29%) and imports from China (67%) and Asia and Pacific (4%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 46e9f84b-3ced-30db-9090-34e88402750d
Domestic production and imports of single-crystalline silicon panels installed in the US and other American countries. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_46e9f84b-3ced-30db-9090-34e88402750d.xml</text>
